WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:02.980
[Low strings as the squad sets off]

00:03.000 --> 00:04.913
[Rifle fire as smoke spreads]

00:04.933 --> 00:06.880
[Tracks rumble across the field]

00:06.900 --> 00:08.213
[Tank cannon fires]

00:08.233 --> 00:10.547
[Gunfire runs along the trench]

00:10.567 --> 00:12.013
[Distant fire at the mortar pit]

00:12.033 --> 00:13.747
[Mortar bursts in the trenches]

00:13.767 --> 00:16.080
[Boat engine and surf as the squad goes ashore]

00:16.100 --> 00:18.747
[Patrol ship fires across the harbour]

00:18.767 --> 00:22.513
[Jet engines climb over the harbour]

00:22.533 --> 00:25.480
[Drums and brass swell over the water impacts]
